    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A fighting game where you can control your reach! ? </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >During the match, in exchange for your own health</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You can extend the reach of your weapon! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you extend your reach, you will be more likely to be defeated, but</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You can instantly overcome situations where you are at a disadvantage! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You can also shorten the extended reach, so use it depending on the battle situation! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;It will make you more likely to die, but it will increase your reach...&quot;</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > &quot;I'm at a disadvantage in terms of distance, but I'll try to conserve my stamina...&quot; </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > It's interesting how both of them keep being caught between choices that are likely to lead to victory! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The feeling of pleasure when the decision you made after thinking about it directly leads to victory is exceptional! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Gain a new sense of victory by flexibly adjusting your reach according to your opponent's actions! </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A fighting game where you can control your reach! ? </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >During the match, in exchange for your own health</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You can extend the reach of your weapon! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you extend your reach, you will be more likely to be defeated, but</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You can instantly overcome situations where you are at a disadvantage! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You can also shorten the extended reach, so use it depending on the battle situation! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;It will make you more likely to die, but it will increase your reach...&quot;</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > &quot;I'm at a disadvantage in terms of distance, but I'll try to conserve my stamina...&quot; </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > It's interesting how both of them keep being caught between choices that are likely to lead to victory! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The feeling of pleasure when the decision you made after thinking about it directly leads to victory is exceptional! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Gain a new sense of victory by flexibly adjusting your reach according to your opponent's actions! </h2>",
    "short_description": "A fighting game where you can control your reach! ? During the match, in exchange for your own health You can extend the reach of your weapon! Adjust your reach and grab a new sense of victory!",
